  "decision": "The remaining blocker is not another Firestaff movement implementation patch. It is a missing original PC/I34E route-key transcript with enough source-visible state to bind keyboard-buffer token, command queue delta, F0380 pop/dispatch, party tuple delta, and viewport present boundary.",
